#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_lure.ex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "NPCs wander on their own schedules — if someone isn't where you expect, wait or look elsewhere."
msgstr "NPC会按自己的日程四处走动——如果某人不在你预想的地方,请等一等或去别处找找。"

